              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Bonken is a Dutch four-player trick-taking compendium game with eleven rounds, each using a different penalty or objective."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "A Dutch compendium game in the Barbu family, built from a sequence of trick-taking contracts."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
