              "text": "52-card standard pack"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "52-card standard pack, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Deal the full 52-card pack to four players for each round; the round contract changes across the eleven deals."
